WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.744 --> 00:00:17.591
"It is so Jason said.

2
00:00:18.451 --> 00:00:20.772
He fanned himself with his notebook in the gym.

3
00:00:20.792 --> 00:00:22.233
"I know.

4
00:00:23.013 --> 00:00:23.973
I'm sweating.

5
00:00:24.774 --> 00:00:27.275
And I'm just standing here," Bobby said.

6
00:00:28.835 --> 00:00:30.176
Miss Shelly blew her whistle.

7
00:00:31.192 --> 00:00:33.154
There was a large cooler by her feet.

8
00:00:33.174 --> 00:00:40.879
"Today I brought strawberries, bananas, peaches, milk, and ice cream.

9
00:00:42.080 --> 00:00:44.922
We're going to make an ice-cold treat," she said.

10
00:00:44.942 --> 00:00:47.604
"Milk shakes!"

11
00:00:47.644 --> 00:00:50.206
Izzie cried, jumping up and down.

12
00:00:50.466 --> 00:00:53.528
"Yes," Bobby said, pumping his fist.

13
00:00:54.849 --> 00:00:58.612
"Mmm I like peach milk shakes," Nina said.

14
00:00:59.572 --> 00:01:01.753
Jason stared at the ice cream in the cooler.

15
00:01:04.275 --> 00:01:07.257
"Milk shakes are easy to make," Miss Shelly explained.

16
00:01:07.277 --> 00:01:14.281
"All we do is put the ingredients into the blender and—" "Blend, blend, blend!"

17
00:01:14.721 --> 00:01:15.502
finished Izzie.

18
00:01:16.502 --> 00:01:17.783
Nina read the first step.

19
00:01:17.803 --> 00:01:20.505
"Put strawberries into the blender."

20
00:01:20.525 --> 00:01:25.928
"Then add one ripe banana," Bobby said.

21
00:01:26.860 --> 00:01:29.482
"And one cup of peaches," Jason said.

22
00:01:29.502 --> 00:01:34.125
"Next add one and a half cups of vanilla ice cream.

23
00:01:35.126 --> 00:01:36.687
Yum," Izzie said.

24
00:01:37.588 --> 00:01:39.969
She scooped ice cream into the measuring cup.

25
00:01:39.989 --> 00:01:45.013
"Then we put in one and a half cups of ice cubes," Nina said.

26
00:01:45.033 --> 00:01:47.935
"Ooh, it's cold in the cooler!"

27
00:01:47.955 --> 00:01:54.880
"And then add half a cup of milk," Izzie said, pouring carefully.

28
00:01:55.676 --> 00:01:57.817
"Wow! We're done already."

29
00:01:57.837 --> 00:02:01.738
"Almost done," Miss Shelly corrected.

30
00:02:01.758 --> 00:02:06.799
"Jason, will you put the lid on the blender and turn it on for us?"

31
00:02:07.759 --> 00:02:10.080
Jason put the lid on the blender and turned it on.

32
00:02:10.120 --> 00:02:17.302
Whirrrrrr The blender hummed and buzzed as the blades spun around.

33
00:02:18.802 --> 00:02:22.163
The kids heard the ice cubes crack and bang against the glass.

34
00:02:23.043 --> 00:02:24.544
Then the sound became softer.

35
00:02:26.484 --> 00:02:29.567
"I think our milk shakes are ready," Miss Shelly said.

36
00:02:30.728 --> 00:02:34.831
She filled Nina, Bobby, and Izzie's glasses with ice-cold milk shakes.

37
00:02:36.352 --> 00:02:40.336
When she reached for Jason's, he suddenly put his hands over the glass.

38
00:02:40.356 --> 00:02:42.998
"No!" he cried.

39
00:02:43.018 --> 00:02:45.700
"Jason, what's the matter?

40
00:02:46.581 --> 00:02:48.162
Don't you want to try the milk shake?"

41
00:02:48.482 --> 00:02:49.443
Miss Shelly asked.

42
00:02:49.463 --> 00:02:53.086
"No," he said again, shaking his head.

43
00:02:53.927 --> 00:02:55.228
Everyone looked at Jason.

44
00:02:56.936 --> 00:02:57.637
"Why not?"

45
00:02:58.017 --> 00:02:58.798
Bobby asked.

46
00:03:00.439 --> 00:03:04.743
"Yeah, it's really good," Izzie said, taking a sip of hers.

47
00:03:04.763 --> 00:03:07.985
"Well, actually I don't like milk."

48
00:03:08.426 --> 00:03:09.427
Jason looked down.

49
00:03:09.447 --> 00:03:11.869
"And I don't like ice cream either.

50
00:03:12.649 --> 00:03:13.770
I'm weird, okay?"

51
00:03:16.132 --> 00:03:17.213
"You're not weird."

52
00:03:17.573 --> 00:03:18.374
Bobby grinned.

53
00:03:18.394 --> 00:03:22.397
"Well, you are weird, but not because of that."

54
00:03:22.417 --> 00:03:25.300
"I am weird.

55
00:03:26.104 --> 00:03:27.445
Kids are supposed to like milk.

56
00:03:28.346 --> 00:03:31.309
Kids are supposed to love ice cream," Jason said.

57
00:03:31.329 --> 00:03:35.874
"Kids don't have to like anything," Miss Shelly said.

58
00:03:35.894 --> 00:03:40.218
"And it's so easy to make a fruit smoothie instead of a milk shake.

59
00:03:41.199 --> 00:03:43.701
We'll just use juice instead of milk and ice cream."

60
00:03:45.343 --> 00:03:46.604
She dug through the cooler.

61
00:03:46.624 --> 00:03:50.208
"Aha! I knew I had mango juice!"

62
00:03:51.144 --> 00:03:56.110
Everyone helped put strawberries, banana, peaches, ice cubes, and juice into the blender.

63
00:03:59.914 --> 00:04:02.156
Jason's fruit smoothie was done in a minute.

64
00:04:02.176 --> 00:04:04.879
"Thanks, guys."

65
00:04:05.460 --> 00:04:06.321
He took a sip.

66
00:04:06.961 --> 00:04:08.843
"Mmm! Smoothies are great!"
